    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Cat named Gossamergoober accompanied with an awesome sound track.<br><br>Run, jump, collect chicken and catch the bugs in this adorable platformer for anyone that loves cats. <br><br>Includes various game modes such that involve speed running or just casual fun over 13 varied stages and game modes.<br><br>Catch the Bugs Mode involves catching all of the bugs before\u00a0Gossamergoober runs out of energy and falls asleep. <br><br>Find Barnicle Mode involves searching for and finding Barnicle the Elder Cat.<br><br>Set times for completing stages and try and get your best times for each mode and stage completion.<br><br>Search for collectable music boxes and unlock the sound track.<br><br> Unlock Trophies.<br><br>Access options that change the gameplay accessibility for casual play and music options.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Cat named Gossamergoober accompanied with an awesome sound track.<br><br>Run, jump, collect chicken and catch the bugs in this adorable platformer for anyone that loves cats. <br><br>Includes various game modes such that involve speed running or just casual fun over 13 varied stages and game modes.<br><br>Catch the Bugs Mode involves catching all of the bugs before\u00a0Gossamergoober runs out of energy and falls asleep. <br><br>Find Barnicle Mode involves searching for and finding Barnicle the Elder Cat.<br><br>Set times for completing stages and try and get your best times for each mode and stage completion.<br><br>Search for collectable music boxes and unlock the sound track.<br><br> Unlock Trophies.<br><br>Access options that change the gameplay accessibility for casual play and music options.</p>",
